                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby, chargé, to
                        Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 50.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-09-19"><hi rendition="#italic">September 19,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Naval engagement off North Korea 17th; five Chinese, three Japanese vessels
                    reported destroyed; fleet at Port Arthur.</p>
